These are the primary sources the csoh.org kill chain cites. Every fact about the incident in this deck comes from that page.

CISA's advisory AA23-158A covers Cl0p's exploitation of CVE-2023-34362, and the page says it carried the indicators the hunting defense points to. As their titles say, Mandiant's post covers the zero-day exploitation, Rapid7's gives a timeline of events, and Unit 42's is a threat brief on MOVEit. MITRE's page defines T1505.003, the web shell technique behind stage 03.

The background slides name their own sources, from OWASP and MITRE ATT&CK.

